Sorry if this is OffTopic but it might still be interesting for you. To
reduce the traffic in your group either contact me direct or send
answers, comments to the wyoDesktop mailing list.

I've created a project ("http://wyodesktop.sourceforge.net/") which
centers around the framebuffer (DirectFB) for its graphical output.
Since you are/were also involved in a similar project you might be
interested in mine as well. You are welcomed to look through the project
and make suggestions/corrections
("http://wyodesktop.sourceforge.net/feedback.php") whatever you like. If
you don't have time but like to be informed what's going on just
subscribe to the wyodesktop-users mailing list ("").

If you aren't interested for whatever reasons just say so. Anyway you
are welcomed to look into wyoDesktop anytime later when it's more clear
how it proceeds. To get an image what I've done so far have a look a my
other projects below.

